id: megath
name: Megath
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Demon
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: >
  Demon Person Subrace, Gigantic Demon effect chosen for the Option effect of Denizen of the Demon Realm
description: >
  While some Demons are already massive in size, these Demons are true behemoths, dwarfing even skyscrapers.
